<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>DON'T</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Ari Abdul</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">DON'T</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">09KcJTiSWfibriFPchj0Jt</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.663" end="00:17.364">You been playing with my mind in a cycle</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.364" end="00:21.891">Know you wanna take a bite but it's fatal</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.891" end="00:26.753">I'll give you hell, give you paradise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.753" end="00:29.817">Where there's a thrill, there's a sacrifice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.817" end="00:36.587" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.587" end="00:39.176">Oh you say that you want it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.176" end="00:41.630">So baby come get it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.630" end="00:43.130">Get it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.842" end="00:44.342">Don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.090" end="00:46.137">Just talk about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.137" end="00:48.898">Oh I know you're addicted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.898" end="00:51.226">So baby come hit it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.226" end="00:52.726">Hit it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.431" end="00:53.931">Don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.702" end="00:55.202">Just talk about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.027" end="00:56.527" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.737" end="01:00.443">You been wasting all your time on these vices</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.443" end="01:05.025">Pull you undertake your breath like the sirens</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.025" end="01:09.799">I'll give you hell, give you paradise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.799" end="01:13.053">Where there's a thrill, there's a sacrifice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.053" end="01:14.967" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.967" end="01:17.550">Oh you say that you want it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.550" end="01:19.989">So baby come get it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.989" end="01:21.489">Get it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.105" end="01:22.605">Don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.415" end="01:24.444">Just talk about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.444" end="01:27.168">Oh I know you're addicted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.168" end="01:29.513">So baby come hit it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.513" end="01:31.013">Hit it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.796" end="01:32.296">Don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.020" end="01:33.520">Just talk about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.513" end="01:41.221" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.221" end="01:49.221">Don't just talk about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.067" end="01:55.067">Don't just talk about it</p></div></body></tt>